<a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=82812/pyretic-legguards">
<img alt="Pyretic Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_dungeonplate_c_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyretic Legguards</span></a></td>
<td>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=59150/flameweaver-koegler">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Flameweaver Koegler</span></a> <span class="icon-heroic"></span></td></tr>
