<img alt="Anchoring Sabatons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_dungeonplate_c_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anchoring Sabatons</span></a></td>
<td>
