<a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81251/blade-trap-signet">
<img alt="Blade Trap Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_135.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blade Trap Signet</span></a></td>
