<img alt="Carbonic Carbuncle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_09.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carbonic Carbuncle</span></a></td>
