<img alt="Inelava, Spirit of Inebriation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_1h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inelava, Spirit of Inebriation</span></a></td>
