<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Frost Death Knights</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This includes Rare Mobs, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50352/qunas">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas</span></a>, but also World Bosses, such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_hunter_pet_devilsaur.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta is the T15-equivalent of Galleon, offering a wide range of rare epic items, as well as a very small chance of dropping the mount <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94228/reins-of-the-cobalt-primordial-direhorn">
<img alt="Reins of the Cobalt Primordial Direhorn" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mount_triceratopsmount_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Cobalt Primordial Direhorn</span></a>. You should aim to kill the boss every single week for the chance of items such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95153/tyrant-king-battleplate">
<img alt="Tyrant King Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tyrant King Battleplate</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95192/belt-of-the-tyrannotitan">
<img alt="Belt of the Tyrannotitan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Tyrannotitan</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95199/carnotaur-battlegloves">
<img alt="Carnotaur Battlegloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Carnotaur Battlegloves</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95180/overcompensating-chain-of-the-alpha-male">
<img alt="Overcompensating Chain of the Alpha Male" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_121.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Overcompensating Chain of the Alpha Male</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95167/ring-of-king-kangrom">
<img alt="Ring of King Kangrom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_173.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of King Kangrom</span></a>. Should you be fortunate enough to obtain one of these items, they will outperform their Celestial Dungeon-equivalent. Make sure to gear around these.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>Nalak is also worth attempting every single week. They have the chance of dropping PvP gear, as well as T15 Gloves <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95226/gauntlets-of-the-all-consuming-maw">
<img alt="Gauntlets of the All-Consuming Maw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gloves_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gauntlets of the All-Consuming Maw</span></a> and Legs <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95228/greaves-of-the-all-consuming-maw">
<img alt="Greaves of the All-Consuming Maw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_deathknight_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greaves of the All-Consuming Maw</span></a>. Furthermore, they have a very small chance of dropping the rare mount <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95057/reins-of-the-thundering-cobalt-cloud-serpent">
<img alt="Reins of the Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>Salyis' Warband, also commonly referred to as "Galleon", has a very small chance of dropping a random item level 496 piece. None of these are pre-raid BiS at this point, but there are still a handful of powerful items, such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90456/cord-of-crazed-strength">
<img alt="Cord of Crazed Strength" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of Crazed Strength</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90438/signet-of-the-bandit-lord">
<img alt="Signet of the Bandit Lord" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Bandit Lord</span></a>, making a weekly trip to Valley of the Four Winds worth your time.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a headstart on your Tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90912/angerforged-stompers">
<img alt="Angerforged Stompers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Angerforged Stompers</span></a>, a decent early pair of boots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Rare Mobs</span></h3>There are tons of Rare mobs scattered around Pandaria, and each one has their own unique drop. Most of these are toys, cosmetics, or similar items, but a small handful can drop strong equipment. None of these items are likely to last you until raiding, but they can be a great stepping stone when gearing in pre-raid content.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=51078/ferdinand">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ferdinand</span></a> and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50823/mister-ferocious">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Mister Ferocious</span></a> drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87652/ook-breaker-mace">
<img alt="Ook-Breaker Mace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_pandung_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ook-Breaker Mace</span></a>, an ilvl 420 Weapon</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50352/qunas">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90717/qunas-apocryphal-legplates">
<img alt="Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qu'nas' Apocryphal Legplates</span></a>, a ilvl 440 pair of Legs</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50388/torik-ethis">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Torik-Ethis</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90718/torik-ethis-bloodied-legguards">
<img alt="Torik-Ethis' Bloodied Legguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Torik-Ethis' Bloodied Legguards</span></a>, a ilvl 440 pair of Legs</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Frost Death Knights in Phase 3</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, especially in earlier stages of gearing. While many of these items are mostly relevant in the earliest stages of the game, the introduction of <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>  does yield some useful items when gearing up for Phase 3 raiding. Remember to get your Reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1359/the-black-prince">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Black Prince</span></a> done as well, as this yields powerful Gems.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-black-prince">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/levelupicon-lfd.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> The Black Prince</span></h3>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
<table class="exclude-units grid" style="width: 900px; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>
<b>Reputation</b></td>
<td>
<b>Item</b></td>
<td>
<b>Price</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>
<span class="rep-honored">Honored</span></td>
<td>
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89881/crystallized-terror">
<img alt="Crystallized Terror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendary_breathofblackprince_agi.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystallized Terror</span></a></td>
<td>
<span class="moneygold">10,000</span></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>
<span class="rep-revered">Revered</span></td>
<td>
<a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=93403/eye-of-the-black-prince">
<img alt="Eye of the Black Prince" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/levelupicon-lfd.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of the Black Prince</span></a>
<br/>
<a class="q7 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=254313/grand-commendation-of-the-black-prince">
<img alt="Grand Commendation of the Black Prince" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_orgrimmarraid_trinket_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Grand Commendation of the Black Prince</span></a></td>
<td>
<span class="moneygold">2,500</span>
<br/>
<span class="moneygold">50</span></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>
